WEBVTT

00:05:58.813 --> 00:06:00.147
There is hope.

00:06:00.189 --> 00:06:04.110
Scientists around the world
are utilizing new technologies

00:06:04.151 --> 00:06:07.321
to cryopreserve
even living coral fragments

00:06:07.363 --> 00:06:11.075
that can be transplanted
onto artificial reefs.

00:06:11.075 --> 00:06:14.161
This is just the beginning
of some of the work that is pioneering

00:06:14.203 --> 00:06:15.704
and can happen.

00:06:16.122 --> 00:06:20.668
I'm most excited about the use
of the new technologies

00:06:20.709 --> 00:06:23.337
for developing stem cells.

00:06:23.379 --> 00:06:25.965
Now these stem cells could be used

00:06:25.965 --> 00:06:32.179
to actually genome edit in
thermal resilience to warming oceans.